OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 13, stabbed as youths aged 14
OL,4,Aand 16 arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy has been seriously
OL,7,Finjured and two teenage boys arrested
OL,8,Fafter reports of a stabbing outside
OL,9,FManchester's Arndale Centre.
OL,11,FOfficers from Greater Manchester Police
OL,12,F(GMP) were called to the incident on
OL,13,FMarket Street at 19:00 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,15,FA GMP spokesperson said a 13-year-old
OL,16,Fboy was found and taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwith potentially life-changing
OL,18,Finjuries.
