OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 13, stabbed as youths aged 14
OL,4,Aand 16 arrested
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenage boys, aged 14 and 16, have
OL,7,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of affray
OL,8,Fand remain in custody for questioning,
OL,9,Fwith inquiries ongoing, they added.
